.Dd November 17, 2026
.Dt UNGET 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm unget
.Nd cancel an SCCS get
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl ns
.Op Fl r Ar SID
.Ar file ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility maps each SCCS file to its pending p-file
.Pq Pa s.foo No to Pa p.foo
and restores it.
The
.Fl s
option suppresses output,
.Fl n
keeps the p-file, and
.Fl r
accepts a revision id for compatibility.
.Pp
Full SCCS delta bookkeeping is outside this bounded implementation; the
utility never fabricates a revision.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 when every p-file is restored, 1 on a file error and 2 on usage
errors.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr what 1
